// Registry Set With Crypto-Classes From The "Cryptography" PowerShell Namespace | T1027.010, T1059.001, T1547.001 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules-threat-hunting/windows/registry/registry_set/registry_set_powershell_crypto_namespace.yml
registry.path:*\\Shell\\Open\\Command* AND (winlog.event_data.Details:(*powershell* OR *pwsh*)) AND winlog.event_data.Details:*System.Security.Cryptography.* AND (winlog.event_data.Details:(*.AesCryptoServiceProvider* OR *.DESCryptoServiceProvider* OR *.DSACryptoServiceProvider* OR *.RC2CryptoServiceProvider* OR *.Rijndael* OR *.RSACryptoServiceProvider* OR *.TripleDESCryptoServiceProvider*))
